abstract: >-
  The Quran Vision Corpus (v6.3.0; supersedes v6.2.3), led and authored by Project Lead & Principal Investigator Mehmet Yarıcı (ORCID: 0009-0003-0356-8582; Uludağ University Faculty of Theology / Republic of Türkiye Ministry of National Education), with Academic Advisor Mehmet Emin Koç (ORCID: 0000-0002-1025-5643; Azerbaijan National Academy of Sciences / AMEA, Institute of Philosophy and Sociology), is a bilingual (Turkish/English) academic research corpus and interactive digital cockpit comprising 17 foundational Quranic verse monographs (34 TR/EN monographs: QV-2026-001 through QV-2026-017, including Kahf 18:83-98 and Muhammad 47:4 / An-Nur 24:33 / Al-Balad 90:13). Quality Assurance & Source Verification: gem_lint.py (V1–V17 Algorithmic Audit, L-2501..L-2508) & V16.2 Multi-Server Source Registry (371/371 Verified Sources: 241 Shamela + 18 Altafsir + 17 Ganjoor/Persian + 95 Institutional/Academic DOI & TDV; Internal Sample Verification: 86/371 [23.2%] — Mehmet Yarıcı). PDF Inventory: 38 Külliyat PDF'i (34 Tekil Monografi + 2 TR/EN Tam Külliyat [v6.3.0] + 1 İSNAD-2 Klasik Arapça Veritabanları Rehberi [ISNAD_2_Klasik_Arapca_Veritabanlari_Rehberi.pdf] + 1 TYMM DKAB 15 Âyet Ders Tasarımı Rehberi [TYMM_DKAB_15_Ayet_Ders_Tasarimi_Rehberi.pdf]) + 3 T.C. Millî Eğitim Bakanlığı (MEB) III. Maarif Kongresi (MOIJUB) PDF'i (Özet + Tam Metin + Sözlü Sunum) — Toplam 41 PDF.
